              "name": "messages",
              "value": "[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"You are a Python/Nornir code generation expert. Based on the workflow design provided, generate complete, production-ready Python code.\\n\\nGenerate:\\n1. Nornir inventory files (hosts.yaml, groups.yaml, defaults.yaml)\\n2. Main workflow Python script with proper error handling\\n3. Custom Nornir tasks if needed\\n4. Configuration templates (Jinja2)\\n5. Test scripts for validation\\n6. Requirements.txt file\\n7. README.md with usage instructions\\n\\nEnsure code follows best practices:\\n- Proper error handling and logging\\n- Type hints and docstrings\\n- Modular design with reusable functions\\n- Security considerations\\n- Performance optimization\\n\\nReturn as JSON with file_name: file_content pairs.\\n\\nWorkflow Design: {{ $('Claude Project Analysis').first().json.content[0].text | fromJson.workflow_design }}\\nTask Specifications: {{ $('Claude Project Analysis').first().json.content[0].text | fromJson.task_specifications }}\\nRequired Plugins: {{ $('Claude Project Analysis').first().json.content[0].text | fromJson.required_plugins }}\\nPython Dependencies: {{ $('Claude Project Analysis').first().json.content[0].text | fromJson.python_dependencies }}\\n\\nGenerate complete Python/Nornir implementation.\"}]"
            }
          ]
        },
