              "name": "messages",
              "value": "[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"You are a network automation testing expert. Analyze test results and determine if the workflow needs improvements.\\n\\nIf tests failed:\\n1. Analyze error messages and logs\\n2. Identify root causes\\n3. Suggest specific code fixes\\n4. Generate improved code\\n5. Provide debugging recommendations\\n\\nIf tests passed:\\n1. Validate completeness\\n2. Check for edge cases\\n3. Suggest optimizations\\n4. Approve for production\\n\\nReturn JSON with:\\n- status: 'passed' or 'failed'\\n- analysis: Detailed analysis\\n- improvements: Specific improvements needed\\n- fixed_code: Updated code if fixes needed\\n- recommendations: Next steps\\n\\nTest Results:\\n{{ $('Test Generated Workflow').first().json }}\\n\\nOriginal Code:\\n{{ $('Claude Code Generation').first().json.content[0].text | fromJson }}\\n\\nAnalyze and provide recommendations.\"}]"
            }
